    Optional chroma‑safe background

10. Referee / Table Official Mode (Mobile‑Friendly)

A simplified UI for:

    Start/stop timer

    Add goals

    Add suspensions

    Call timeout

This is extremely useful if someone is operating the scoreboard from a phone or tablet.
11. Horn / Buzzer Button

Handball uses a table buzzer to signal:

    Substitution errors

    Timeouts

    End of period

You can add:

    A “Buzzer” button

    Play a sound on the display device

12. Match Configuration Screen

Before the match:

    Team names

    Team colors

    Match type (league, cup, friendly)

    Match duration (youth games use 2×25 or 2×20)

    Overtime enabled or disabled

13. Automatic Clock Rules

Handball has strict timing rules:

    Clock stops on referee whistle

    Clock stops for suspensions

    Clock stops for timeouts

    Clock stops for injuries

You can add:

A “Referee Whistle” button Auto‑stop timer on certain events
14. Goal Animation on Display

A subtle animation when a team scores:

    Flash team block

    Pulse score

    Show “GOAL!” briefly

This adds a lot of production value.
